OL,3,AAnthropic boss Dario Amodei calls for
OL,4,AAI development to slow down
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe head of AI company Anthropic has
OL,7,Fcalled for the pace of development of
OL,8,Fartificial intelligence models to slow
OL,9,Fdown and to be closely monitored.
OL,11,FDario Amodei wrote in an online essay
OL,12,Fthat developing AI was not in question,
OL,13,Fbut that the risks associated with it
OL,14,Fwere "serious" and that companies and
OL,15,Fgovernments must be given time to
OL,16,Faddress them.
OL,18,FThe bosses of two rival AI firms, Sam
OL,19,FAltman of OpenAI and Elon Musk, have
OL,20,Fboth said they agree with Amodei.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,110,105,200,160,0,100
