OL,3,AAnthropic boss Dario Amodei calls for
OL,4,AAI development to slow down
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere have been growing concerns
OL,7,Frecently about the technology's
OL,8,Fpotential risks. An AI researcher who
OL,9,Fleft Anthropic told the BBC that "if we
OL,10,Fdon't slow down at the current rate of
OL,11,Fprogress, there is a strong chance that
OL,12,Fwe could all die in the immediate
OL,13,Ffuture".
